              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha abaJuda ababeseShushani babuthana ngolweshumi nantathu nangolweshumi nane; ngosuku lweshumi nanhlanu lwaso baphumula, balwenza lwaba usuku lwedili nolokuthokoza.",
          "type": "text",
